L</span><span>WONDERS</span></p></header>\n                <div class=\"work-title-strip\"><h1 id=\"home-title\" data-page-heading=\"\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-home=\"title\" class=\"cover-title\">___JIUYI_HOME_title___</h1><p data-home=\"subtitle\" class=\"cover-subtitle\">___JIUYI_HOME_subtitle___</p></div>\n                <figure class=\"flower-plate\" aria-label=\"杏黄色小花与雾蓝蝴蝶的印刷插画\"><div class=\"plate-notes\"><span class=\"plate-note-heading\">FIELD<br>NOTES</span><span class=\"plate-note-number\">01</span><span class=\"plate-color\"><i></i>杏黄</span><span class=\"plate-color blue\"><i></i>雾蓝</span><span class=\"plate-note-small\">petals,<br>ink &amp;<br>everyday<br>stories.</span></div><svg class=\"hero-art\" viewBox=\"0 0 1536 1024\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#flower-art\" /></svg><figcaption><span>FLOWERS FOR THE FIRST PAGE</span><span>PL. 01</span></figcaption></figure>\n                <nav class=\"cover-navigation\" aria-label=\"选择页面\"><a href=\"#about\" class=\"cover-link about-link\"><span class=\"link-title\">作品资料 <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span><span class=\"link-caption\">01 / ABOUT THE STORY</span></a><a href=\"#openings\" class=\"cover-link openings-link\"><span class=\"link-title\">选择开场 <span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span><span class=\"link-caption\">02 / CONTENTS · ___JIUYI_COUNT___ 篇</span></a></nav>\n            </div>\n            <footer class=\"frame-footer\"><span>点击栏目，翻开内页</span><span>OPEN THE JOURNAL ↗</span></footer>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"about-view\" id=\"about\" data-view=\"about\" hidden aria-labelledby=\"about-title\">\n    <nav class=\"page-topbar\" aria-label=\"页面导航\"><a href=\"#home\" class=\"back-link\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span> 返回首页</a><span class=\"micro\">FOLIO / 01</span></nav>\n    <header class=\"section-heading\"><span class=\"micro\">BEFORE THE FIRST PAGE</span><h2 id=\"about-title\" data-page-heading=\"\" t